{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hey Jolene, nice to meet you! How's your week going? Anything fun happened?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-ab255ba44017b2765c0d61f1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.725631+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ab255ba44017b2765c0d61f1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ab255ba44017b2765c0d61f1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hi Deb! Good to meet you! Yeah, my week's been busy. I finished an electrical engineering project last week - took a lot of work, but it's done now. Anything fun happening for you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-0480884735f32b5874d05e3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.745883+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0480884735f32b5874d05e3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0480884735f32b5874d05e3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Congrats! Last week I visited a place that holds a lot of memories for me. It was my mother`s old house."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-7944fd17934306367c888c3f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.766329+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7944fd17934306367c888c3f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7944fd17934306367c888c3f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Why does it hold such special memories for you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-c6f2c9cd8d424d84510829d9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.778387+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6f2c9cd8d424d84510829d9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6f2c9cd8d424d84510829d9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It was full of memories, she passed away a few years ago. This is our last photo together."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-76af4bcc6231253fbf50d560", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.795511+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "76af4bcc6231253fbf50d560", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "76af4bcc6231253fbf50d560", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Sorry about your loss, Deb. My mother also passed away last year. This is my room in her house, I also have many memories there. Is there anything special about it you remember?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-fc59e18812b64d066e6c5385", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.806452+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc59e18812b64d066e6c5385", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc59e18812b64d066e6c5385", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: My mom's house had a special bench near the window. She loved to sit there every morning and take in the view. I come to sit here sometimes, it helps me stay connected to her."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-73fe44d8c5f2c2512f5d90a8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.824412+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73fe44d8c5f2c2512f5d90a8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73fe44d8c5f2c2512f5d90a8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Staying connected is super important. Do you have something to remember her by? This pendant reminds me of my mother, she gave it to me in 2010 in Paris."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-7ac12c28eca6b917b910677d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.839277+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ac12c28eca6b917b910677d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ac12c28eca6b917b910677d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Yes, I also have a pendant that reminds me of my mother. And what is special for you about your jewelry?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-7fa0de2859701fb156c870f4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.857034+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7fa0de2859701fb156c870f4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7fa0de2859701fb156c870f4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: It has a special symbol on it that represents freedom for me. It's a nice reminder to go for my goals and not get held back."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-de225461447d1d269f93ff77", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.872224+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "de225461447d1d269f93ff77", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "de225461447d1d269f93ff77", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It should really give you strength and energy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-ec7fa9ff1165d99286abbedd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.884851+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec7fa9ff1165d99286abbedd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec7fa9ff1165d99286abbedd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Do you have goals?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-2dd2d629e58709dd29fb711b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.897019+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2dd2d629e58709dd29fb711b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2dd2d629e58709dd29fb711b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: One of my goals is to keep teaching yoga and supporting my community. I'm passionate about helping people find peace and joy through it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-7a3c7388ec9b4069c7fdc53c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.910023+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7a3c7388ec9b4069c7fdc53c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7a3c7388ec9b4069c7fdc53c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: What inspired you to go down this route?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-6b9fe3162e2aae38be4f8c29", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.922853+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6b9fe3162e2aae38be4f8c29", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6b9fe3162e2aae38be4f8c29", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Yoga helped me find peace during a rough time, and now I'm passionate about sharing that with others."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-90f122d5b0abe23c150f3465", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.937289+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "90f122d5b0abe23c150f3465", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "90f122d5b0abe23c150f3465", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: It is truly inspiring!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-d2cafe5d47770e09c658471b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.951712+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d2cafe5d47770e09c658471b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d2cafe5d47770e09c658471b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Gotta run, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-e4953d252740b846b643b18c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.968723+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e4953d252740b846b643b18c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e4953d252740b846b643b18c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Looking forward to the next chat!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_1-eb883560e57c56a97e3853e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:55:09.984232+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eb883560e57c56a97e3853e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eb883560e57c56a97e3853e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
